WEBVTT

00:12.750 --> 00:14.210
Here's the plan for today.

00:14.480 --> 00:16.680
All members of the investigation team,

00:16.760 --> 00:17.620
except Li Qian,

00:17.920 --> 00:20.320
will participate in tonight's operation.

00:20.550 --> 00:22.320
The core members involved in the arrest

00:22.320 --> 00:23.320
will all be armed.

00:25.100 --> 00:26.280
To prevent Mei Dong

00:26.370 --> 00:28.510
from sending someone
to stake out near our station,

00:28.510 --> 00:29.440
we will all

00:29.980 --> 00:31.070
act as usual

00:31.220 --> 00:32.350
[Police]

00:31.620 --> 00:33.390
and get off work in plain clothes.

00:33.390 --> 00:34.280
Once outside,

00:34.320 --> 00:37.450
we will gather at
our respective designated locations.

00:38.220 --> 00:40.030
With Guanlan Hotel as the center,

00:40.030 --> 00:41.960
we will set up surveillance
in all key areas

00:41.960 --> 00:44.210
within a one-kilometer radius.

00:44.320 --> 00:46.870
This will form a comprehensive

00:47.200 --> 00:49.460
and mutually supporting encirclement.

00:50.380 --> 00:51.970
Also, all the hotel's entrances and exits

00:51.970 --> 00:54.150
must be staked out
by experienced officers.

00:54.150 --> 00:54.770
Song Xing,

00:55.000 --> 00:56.210
you are in charge of
keeping an eye on Yang Wei.

00:56.210 --> 00:57.810
After Yang Wei meets with the contact,

00:57.810 --> 01:00.030
if it is confirmed to be Mei Dong,

01:00.170 --> 01:01.590
release the information as planned.

01:01.590 --> 01:03.320
You will lead the team to make the arrest.

01:03.320 --> 01:04.069
If the person who shows up

01:04.069 --> 01:05.840
is just a lackey scouting for Mei Dong,

01:05.840 --> 01:06.770
then stand down.

01:07.150 --> 01:07.880
Understood?

01:08.070 --> 01:09.670
-Understood!
-Understood!

01:10.980 --> 01:11.710
Understood.

01:19.350 --> 01:19.760
Chief Zhang,

01:19.760 --> 01:21.220
is this arrangement okay?

01:22.710 --> 01:23.310
Smooth

01:24.039 --> 01:24.980
and detailed.

01:25.430 --> 01:26.630
Okay, I'll go watch the monitors.

01:26.630 --> 01:27.340
I'll go too.

01:28.789 --> 01:29.650
You rest.

01:29.670 --> 01:31.560
I'll carefully handle the whole thing.

01:31.560 --> 01:32.590
Detailed.

01:35.240 --> 01:36.240
Isn't it the same?

03:01.940 --> 03:05.660
[Born with Luck]

03:05.690 --> 03:08.620
[Episode 14]

03:39.150 --> 03:42.190
[September 7, 2012]

03:42.960 --> 03:43.350
Go.

03:43.390 --> 03:44.600
Reassure him.

03:52.030 --> 03:53.490
Sir, what would you like to drink?

03:53.490 --> 03:54.020
Nothing.

03:55.590 --> 03:56.910
Act like a man.

03:56.930 --> 03:58.560
Our guys are all around here.

04:27.600 --> 04:28.270
Yang Wei?

04:30.070 --> 04:30.970
The room is booked.

04:30.970 --> 04:31.800
Let's go up.

04:48.000 --> 04:48.560
Did you come back with Dong

04:48.560 --> 04:49.760
from Southeast Asia?

04:55.510 --> 04:56.970
Are you guys usually busy?

05:03.660 --> 05:04.620
Is he doing well?

05:10.680 --> 05:11.540
Let's go, Yang.

05:23.040 --> 05:23.510
Dong.

05:26.000 --> 05:26.430
Dong.

05:30.600 --> 05:31.120
Phone.

05:32.310 --> 05:32.800
What?

05:33.560 --> 05:34.360
It's the rule.

05:34.560 --> 05:35.000
Yang,

05:35.830 --> 05:37.510
we're responsible for Dong's safety.

05:37.510 --> 05:38.680
If anything goes wrong,

05:38.680 --> 05:40.480
we'd be too ashamed
to stay in the business.

05:40.480 --> 05:41.740
You are Dong's friend,

05:41.870 --> 05:43.130
so please understand.

05:44.190 --> 05:45.000
We're doing this

05:45.000 --> 05:46.130
for Dong's own good.

05:46.750 --> 05:49.550
Don't make things difficult
for us subordinates.

06:00.640 --> 06:01.240
Password.

06:17.750 --> 06:18.680
Leave it with me.

06:25.720 --> 06:26.720
What are you doing?

06:26.720 --> 06:27.260
Yang.

06:27.750 --> 06:28.120
Yang,

06:28.560 --> 06:29.290
bear with us.

06:54.310 --> 06:54.970
Come, Yang,

06:55.390 --> 06:56.250
sit down. Come.

06:58.159 --> 06:59.890
Your technique is pretty good.

07:06.310 --> 07:07.110
Where is Dong?

07:08.750 --> 07:09.310
Yang,

07:09.950 --> 07:11.750
Dong tried to contact Lin Kai,

07:12.950 --> 07:14.550
but his phone was turned off.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.520
Later, he called his home,

07:16.950 --> 07:18.750
and his wife said Lin Kai is dead.

07:19.510 --> 07:20.840
Did you know about this?

07:25.270 --> 07:26.390
How did Lin Kai die?

07:26.750 --> 07:27.800
I don't know.

07:29.240 --> 07:29.720
The police

07:29.720 --> 07:31.380
are investigating it, right?

07:31.950 --> 07:32.560
And they refuse to

07:32.560 --> 07:33.820
disclose any details.

07:35.920 --> 07:37.070
All I know is that Kai's body

07:37.070 --> 07:38.480
was found in an empty lot.

07:39.120 --> 07:40.520
From what you're saying,

07:40.800 --> 07:42.260
did the police come to you?

07:43.920 --> 07:45.000
When he had the accident,

07:45.000 --> 07:46.280
he was driving my car.

07:47.930 --> 07:49.659
I shouldn't have lent it to him.

07:50.130 --> 07:52.730
As soon as I lent it to him,
something happened.

07:54.409 --> 07:55.320
Did the police

07:55.390 --> 07:56.990
ask you about anything else,

07:57.110 --> 07:58.060
such as about business?

07:58.060 --> 07:59.390
How could they not ask?

08:00.680 --> 08:02.080
I just kept my mouth shut.

08:03.680 --> 08:04.240
Since they don't have

08:04.240 --> 08:05.000
anything on me,

08:05.000 --> 08:06.330
what could they do to me?

08:06.600 --> 08:08.800
When the time was up, they just let me go.

08:20.270 --> 08:20.720
Hello?

08:21.190 --> 08:22.240
Sir, do you want a massage?

08:22.240 --> 08:22.680
No.

08:23.600 --> 08:25.240
Sir, the spa is on the third floor.

08:25.240 --> 08:26.480
You can come over and try it,

08:26.480 --> 08:27.410
or we can come up.

08:27.510 --> 08:27.970
No need.

08:28.160 --> 08:28.760
Thank you.

08:44.870 --> 08:45.520
Hello?

08:54.240 --> 08:54.750
Okay.

08:58.240 --> 08:58.880
Yang,

08:59.440 --> 08:59.970
let's go.

09:01.550 --> 09:02.480
Where is Dong?

09:15.320 --> 09:15.850
Let's go.

09:29.240 --> 09:30.900
Aren't there elevators here?

09:34.890 --> 09:38.650
[Guest room corridor 4]

10:21.760 --> 10:22.340
Yang,

10:22.500 --> 10:23.040
go in.

10:32.670 --> 10:33.600
Freeze!

10:35.390 --> 10:36.270
Wei.

10:42.840 --> 10:43.970
Don't recognize me?

10:44.910 --> 10:45.930
D-Dong?

10:46.960 --> 10:48.780
I got plastic surgery.

10:49.580 --> 10:51.440
Not as handsome as before, right?

10:52.360 --> 10:52.720
What?

10:52.750 --> 10:53.480
Sit, sit.

10:54.870 --> 10:55.240
Look.

10:58.360 --> 10:58.890
Right.

11:04.050 --> 11:05.380
This is for your mother.

11:10.360 --> 11:11.030
No, I can't.

11:11.150 --> 11:11.790
It's too expensive.

11:11.790 --> 11:12.780
I can't accept this.

11:12.780 --> 11:13.550
We are brothers.

11:13.550 --> 11:15.080
Why are you being so polite?

11:16.910 --> 11:17.910
Is she doing well?

11:19.000 --> 11:20.030
Very well.

11:20.360 --> 11:21.090
That's good.

11:22.910 --> 11:24.530
Why are you being silly?

11:25.030 --> 11:26.270
My appearance has changed,

11:26.270 --> 11:27.580
but my voice hasn't.

11:27.720 --> 11:28.270
Right?

11:29.030 --> 11:30.000
Yes, Dong.

11:30.840 --> 11:31.960
Yes!

11:34.390 --> 11:36.120
Why did you suddenly come back?

11:37.200 --> 11:38.330
For a business deal.

11:39.550 --> 11:40.240
What kind of business

11:40.240 --> 11:41.640
requires such a big risk?

11:43.120 --> 11:44.440
A deal with Zhou Rong.

11:45.200 --> 11:46.060
Think about it.

11:47.140 --> 11:48.690
That's too risky.

11:48.720 --> 11:50.580
Aren't you a wanted man right now?

11:51.790 --> 11:53.150
How is it risky?

11:53.960 --> 11:56.040
I used my passport

11:56.200 --> 11:59.080
and walked openly

11:59.270 --> 12:00.390
through customs.

12:09.600 --> 12:10.530
Dong, the phone.

12:23.480 --> 12:24.940
Sir, do you need a massage?

12:31.240 --> 12:32.900
It would be good to relax a bit.

12:49.150 --> 12:49.510
Dong!

13:11.480 --> 13:11.930
[Guest room corridor 1]

13:12.030 --> 13:13.080
[Guest room corridor 2]

13:13.130 --> 13:13.470
[Guest room corridor 3]

13:13.910 --> 13:15.040
Yang Wei is exposed.

13:16.170 --> 13:19.170
Mei Dong is taking his men
to the emergency stairwell.

13:19.600 --> 13:21.100
Mei Dong is wearing a red hoodie.

13:21.100 --> 13:22.360
Three people in total.

13:40.550 --> 13:41.000
Freeze!

13:41.000 --> 13:41.200
Police!

13:41.200 --> 13:41.550
Freeze!

13:41.550 --> 13:41.960
Stop!

13:42.120 --> 13:42.600
Police!

13:44.780 --> 13:45.840
-Freeze!
-Freeze!

13:51.000 --> 13:51.680
Dong,

13:52.510 --> 13:53.110
take care.

14:25.750 --> 14:27.240
Wow, resisting arrest.

14:27.260 --> 14:27.960
Look up.

14:33.030 --> 14:34.080
[Photo of Mei Dong, the suspect]

14:34.110 --> 14:35.420
[Wanted]

14:38.360 --> 14:39.020
Is that him?

15:46.000 --> 15:46.630
Captain Wang.

15:46.630 --> 15:47.550
What's wrong with you?

15:47.550 --> 15:48.080
Nothing.

15:48.150 --> 15:49.390
Identify him quickly.

15:49.390 --> 15:50.240
Look up.

15:54.270 --> 15:55.400
This isn't Mei Dong.

15:58.150 --> 15:59.150
Where is Mei Dong?

16:03.200 --> 16:03.910
Search!

16:04.150 --> 16:04.510
Go.

16:06.080 --> 16:06.320
No.

16:06.360 --> 16:07.490
Then I...

16:12.390 --> 16:14.390
You are really a good friend to Dong.

16:15.320 --> 16:15.910
Really?

16:41.440 --> 16:42.000
Police!

17:38.540 --> 17:39.500
[Photo of Mei Dong, the suspect]

17:40.450 --> 17:41.460
[Photo of Mei Dong, the suspect]

18:40.310 --> 18:41.200
Attention all units.

18:41.200 --> 18:42.310
Mei Dong has escaped.

18:42.310 --> 18:44.270
Keep a close eye
on all suspicious persons.

18:44.270 --> 18:45.160
Mei Dong had plastic surgery,

18:45.160 --> 18:47.620
and looks different
from his wanted poster.

19:06.440 --> 19:07.790
Be careful if you spot Mei Dong.

19:07.790 --> 19:08.510
He was once

19:08.510 --> 19:10.510
the Sanda champion of Sanjiangkou.

20:04.510 --> 20:05.580
Hello.

20:06.200 --> 20:07.000
Excuse me,

20:07.030 --> 20:08.000
you look quite different

20:08.000 --> 20:08.940
from the photo.

20:09.110 --> 20:10.120
Are you Mei Dong?

20:10.510 --> 20:12.110
I dare you to let me out!

20:14.200 --> 20:15.130
It really is him.

20:20.460 --> 20:28.970
♪ Snow blankets the Volga River ♪

20:27.790 --> 20:28.990
Attention all units.

20:29.160 --> 20:30.710
Come to the underground loading bay.

20:30.460 --> 20:38.370
♪ Three cars drive over the icy river ♪

20:30.960 --> 20:32.310
Mei Dong has been captured.

20:32.310 --> 20:33.840
Mei Dong has been captured.

20:41.750 --> 20:43.350
This is your overseas phone.

20:43.510 --> 20:44.030
Right?

20:47.310 --> 20:48.510
You used this number

20:48.590 --> 20:49.640
for your MasterCard

20:49.640 --> 20:50.960
and Visa card.

20:51.830 --> 20:53.000
This is your phone.

20:53.160 --> 20:54.160
You can't deny it.

20:58.340 --> 21:00.340
What kind of business are you doing?

21:04.190 --> 21:08.990
[Police]

21:10.240 --> 21:11.440
This is an indictment

21:11.480 --> 21:13.080
found on your computer.

21:12.440 --> 21:13.330
[Civil Complaint]

21:13.240 --> 21:14.200
A foreigner named

21:14.200 --> 21:16.240
Kanokkorn Sukum is going to sue

21:16.350 --> 21:16.960
Zhou Rong's Rongcheng locally

21:16.960 --> 21:19.000
for infringing the patented technology

21:19.000 --> 21:21.160
of rapid concrete hardening

21:21.240 --> 21:22.270
owned by Sumita Company,

21:22.270 --> 21:23.930
which is under her name.

21:24.200 --> 21:26.030
The compensation is 300 million RMB.

21:26.030 --> 21:26.830
Rongcheng

21:26.880 --> 21:28.610
will lose this lawsuit, right?

21:28.790 --> 21:29.880
The 300 million will naturally

21:29.880 --> 21:31.120
flow overseas

21:31.240 --> 21:32.880
as compensation.

21:33.590 --> 21:36.250
You came up with
this money-laundering scheme.

21:42.310 --> 21:42.880
Mei Dong,

21:44.200 --> 21:45.340
using this attitude

21:45.720 --> 21:46.780
towards us is fine.

21:47.160 --> 21:48.020
But I advise you

21:48.270 --> 21:49.270
not to act like this in court.

21:48.600 --> 21:51.040
[Before plastic surgery]

21:51.070 --> 21:54.130
[After plastic surgery]

21:57.590 --> 21:59.720
You laundered the stolen money

21:59.740 --> 22:02.470
from Dinghu's
illegal fundraising case, right?

22:03.640 --> 22:05.840
There are nearly ten thousand victims.

22:06.790 --> 22:08.380
After losing everything,

22:08.720 --> 22:10.030
two jumped off buildings,

22:10.030 --> 22:11.490
and one laid on the tracks.

22:11.750 --> 22:12.880
If the families of the victims

22:12.880 --> 22:14.010
saw you like this...

22:16.310 --> 22:17.480
If you're smart,

22:17.750 --> 22:19.190
confess immediately

22:19.400 --> 22:21.030
and try to get a longer sentence.

22:21.030 --> 22:22.070
For you,

22:22.480 --> 22:23.480
it's safer in jail

22:23.590 --> 22:24.480
than outside.

22:34.030 --> 22:35.360
I can't take it anymore.

22:36.510 --> 22:36.970
I can't.

22:38.240 --> 22:38.960
A genuine smile

22:38.960 --> 22:41.750
is a quarter-second micro-expression.

22:41.920 --> 22:43.920
Anything over five seconds is fake.

22:43.960 --> 22:44.830
You're good.

22:45.510 --> 22:48.000
Aren't your facial muscles tired
after smiling for so long?

22:48.000 --> 22:48.640
Doesn't it ache?

22:48.640 --> 22:50.110
Or is it because of some aftereffects

22:50.110 --> 22:51.640
from your plastic surgery?

22:53.870 --> 22:54.940
[Comparison of Plastic Surgery
Before and After] [Criminal Record]

22:54.070 --> 22:55.400
You really went all out.

22:55.440 --> 22:57.150
Even got it done
in the opposite direction.

22:57.150 --> 22:58.510
The once all-powerful leader

22:58.510 --> 22:59.510
of Jinshuiting

22:59.590 --> 23:01.440
in Sanjiangkou,

23:02.070 --> 23:04.270
you had no choice but to end up like this.

23:04.440 --> 23:05.840
Do you feel a bit wronged?

23:08.400 --> 23:09.400
Who is Kanokkorn?

23:13.340 --> 23:13.520
[Police]

23:13.600 --> 23:14.330
[Personal Information]

23:18.740 --> 23:20.330
[Personal Information]

23:19.750 --> 23:21.400
She's is the leader of the largest gang

23:21.400 --> 23:23.530
on Sixinlan Island in Southeast Asia.

23:23.640 --> 23:25.720
Their biggest business is

23:25.720 --> 23:28.070
laundering money
for people all over the world.

23:28.070 --> 23:28.900
Mr. Mei

23:29.200 --> 23:31.400
remarried not long after going abroad.

23:32.070 --> 23:33.110
The biggest coincidence is

23:33.110 --> 23:34.450
that his bride is named

23:34.480 --> 23:36.110
Kanokkorn Sukum.

23:38.270 --> 23:39.030
Is that pronunciation correct?

23:39.030 --> 23:40.660
Kanokkorn Sukum.

23:40.830 --> 23:41.740
Not bad, yeah?

23:42.920 --> 23:44.160
If my guess is right,

23:45.160 --> 23:46.290
after going abroad,

23:46.630 --> 23:48.160
your money quickly ran out.

23:48.590 --> 23:49.500
When you were at your wits' end,

23:49.500 --> 23:50.820
you happened to meet

23:50.920 --> 23:52.320
this old lady Kanokkorn.

23:52.480 --> 23:55.070
For the sake of wealth
and glory for the rest of his life,

23:55.070 --> 23:56.470
he had no choice but to...

23:56.990 --> 23:57.930
He had no choice.

23:59.750 --> 24:01.070
Mr. Mei is not the boss.

24:01.640 --> 24:02.770
Strictly speaking,

24:03.160 --> 24:05.850
he's just Ms. Kanokkorn's...

24:05.920 --> 24:06.680
Plaything.

24:10.920 --> 24:12.680
With Mr. Mei's
thick eyebrows and big eyes,

24:12.680 --> 24:13.240
would he?

24:14.310 --> 24:15.510
So the one laundering money

24:15.510 --> 24:16.310
is not Mr. Mei.

24:17.270 --> 24:18.440
It's Ms. Kanokkorn.

24:19.110 --> 24:19.920
Now you can understand

24:19.920 --> 24:21.650
why he doesn't dare to confess.

24:22.030 --> 24:23.030
Money laundering

24:23.750 --> 24:25.230
is this gang's

24:25.550 --> 24:26.640
core secret.

24:27.200 --> 24:28.460
If he doesn't confess,

24:28.510 --> 24:30.040
after a few years in prison,

24:30.200 --> 24:31.270
he can go back and live a life of luxury,

24:31.270 --> 24:32.880
accompanying the old lady
in her twilight years.

24:32.880 --> 24:34.330
If he confesses, then...

24:35.270 --> 24:36.600
Stop talking nonsense.

24:38.790 --> 24:40.090
The person who sued

24:40.400 --> 24:42.070
is named Kanokkorn Sukum.

24:43.030 --> 24:44.000
The person I married is named

24:44.000 --> 24:45.270
Kanokkore Sukum.

24:45.750 --> 24:46.880
One ends with an "n."

24:46.880 --> 24:48.380
One ends with an "e."

24:48.590 --> 24:49.720
Thanks a lot.

24:56.220 --> 24:57.730
[Personal Information]

25:01.010 --> 25:02.960
Doesn't look much younger anyway.

25:05.590 --> 25:07.270
What's the relationship

25:08.070 --> 25:09.270
between this Kanokkore

25:09.270 --> 25:10.130
and Kanokkorn?

25:10.200 --> 25:11.160
Is she her

25:12.070 --> 25:12.830
brother's daughter,

25:12.830 --> 25:13.960
sister's daughter,

25:14.510 --> 25:15.510
her own daughter,

25:15.880 --> 25:16.410
or what?

25:16.440 --> 25:17.310
Because at the end of her name,

25:17.310 --> 25:18.110
there is an "e,"

25:18.110 --> 25:18.720
and after her...

25:18.720 --> 25:20.130
She's just my maid!

25:20.350 --> 25:21.150
I used her name

25:21.160 --> 25:22.160
to set up the company.

25:22.160 --> 25:22.970
I married her

25:23.030 --> 25:24.550
just to control the company
behind the scenes.

25:24.550 --> 25:25.750
How could I, Mei Dong,

25:25.750 --> 25:26.800
live off a woman?

25:26.830 --> 25:28.480
I handled all the money laundering

25:28.480 --> 25:29.740
completely by myself.

25:55.440 --> 25:56.310
Since we're on the subject,

25:56.310 --> 25:57.370
just keep talking.

25:58.270 --> 26:00.310
Was the one who approached you
for this business

26:00.310 --> 26:01.200
Zhou Rong?

26:04.350 --> 26:05.650
According to Yang Wei,

26:05.750 --> 26:10.440
[Waiting Area]

26:06.000 --> 26:08.590
this Mei Dong
started with smuggling artifacts.

26:08.590 --> 26:10.450
He's known Liu Bei for a long time.

26:11.030 --> 26:11.850
So earlier,

26:11.880 --> 26:14.140
the bianzhong Zheng Yongbing mentioned

26:14.200 --> 26:15.270
might have been sold by Mei Dong's gang

26:15.270 --> 26:16.110
to Zhou Rong.

26:16.750 --> 26:17.920
It makes perfect sense.

26:17.920 --> 26:19.120
No matter the charge,

26:19.830 --> 26:21.900
as long as Mei Dong exposes Zhou Rong,

26:22.400 --> 26:24.400
we have a reason to investigate him.

26:25.550 --> 26:26.110
Good job.

26:27.200 --> 26:28.040
Keep at it.

26:28.380 --> 26:31.890
[Waiting Area]

27:02.530 --> 27:05.170
[Restricted Caller]

27:15.220 --> 27:17.640
[Restricted Caller]

27:33.200 --> 27:34.460
Mr. Rong, are you okay?

27:36.330 --> 27:38.130
Something happened to Mei Dong.

28:06.550 --> 28:07.160
That'll be all.

28:07.160 --> 28:08.240
Chief Zhang, Captain Wang.

28:08.240 --> 28:10.400
Chief Qi asked you to go over immediately.

28:10.400 --> 28:10.820
What's wrong?

28:10.820 --> 28:12.550
You'll know when you get there.

28:12.830 --> 28:13.510
What is it?

28:14.960 --> 28:16.290
What's wrong, Chief Qi?

28:18.070 --> 28:19.260
A little surprise.

28:19.450 --> 28:20.920
Chief Qi said you guys didn't have lunch,

28:20.920 --> 28:22.440
and specifically asked me
to order from outside.

28:22.440 --> 28:24.100
This meal cost Chief Qi...

28:25.110 --> 28:27.200
There's a major breakthrough in the case,

28:27.200 --> 28:28.590
but you guys haven't even eaten.

28:28.590 --> 28:30.050
I'm slacking as the chief.

28:31.350 --> 28:31.930
Sit.

28:32.720 --> 28:33.590
Yi'ang, sit here.

28:33.590 --> 28:34.050
Li Qian,

28:34.400 --> 28:34.790
come.

28:36.400 --> 28:36.880
Ruijun.

28:37.880 --> 28:38.480
Song Xing.

28:42.880 --> 28:44.170
The result might not be

28:44.200 --> 28:45.690
as good as you thought.

28:46.900 --> 28:47.770
Look at you.

28:48.400 --> 28:49.560
I tricked him a bit,

28:49.640 --> 28:51.440
and he fought back immediately.

28:51.720 --> 28:52.450
Why are you

28:52.480 --> 28:53.370
so vindictive?

28:55.110 --> 28:55.790
Come, come.

28:55.920 --> 28:57.580
These are all ordered for you.

28:58.160 --> 28:59.620
Girls like sweet things.

28:59.830 --> 29:01.090
Have some of this.

29:01.480 --> 29:02.410
And this.

29:02.640 --> 29:03.510
Thank you, Chief Qi.

29:03.510 --> 29:04.440
You're welcome.

29:05.200 --> 29:05.640
Chief Qi.

29:05.640 --> 29:06.270
Don't say anything.

29:06.270 --> 29:07.200
Let me say it.

29:08.750 --> 29:09.520
Mei Dong

29:09.550 --> 29:11.270
confessed to the money laundering.

29:11.270 --> 29:12.000
We have

29:12.030 --> 29:13.960
sufficient reasons to file the case.

29:13.960 --> 29:14.440
Right?

29:15.310 --> 29:15.880
And you,

29:16.310 --> 29:18.000
don't eat anything too greasy.

29:18.000 --> 29:19.160
This bitter gourd and pork soup

29:19.160 --> 29:20.030
is good stuff.

29:20.720 --> 29:21.720
You have some too.

29:22.440 --> 29:24.300
This is free-range chicken soup.

29:24.400 --> 29:25.730
Nourish yourself well.

29:25.750 --> 29:27.590
With Zhou Rong's current situation,

29:27.590 --> 29:29.480
are the conditions met for filing a case?

29:29.480 --> 29:30.220
Chief Qi.

29:31.000 --> 29:31.550
I know.

29:32.430 --> 29:34.290
This isn't the most crucial part.

29:34.590 --> 29:35.990
The most crucial part...

29:36.510 --> 29:38.710
Don't you like eating at street stalls?

29:38.920 --> 29:40.030
This mutton,

29:40.510 --> 29:42.910
they said it was slaughtered this morning.

29:42.960 --> 29:45.070
But Song, eat less of this.

29:47.310 --> 29:48.510
The most crucial part

29:49.200 --> 29:50.860
is that once the case is filed,

29:50.880 --> 29:52.960
we can rightfully

29:53.200 --> 29:54.600
investigate Rongcheng.

29:57.440 --> 29:58.270
Am I right?

30:07.160 --> 30:08.110
Mei Dong confessed he was

30:08.110 --> 30:10.170
about to launder money for Zhou Rong.

30:13.960 --> 30:15.620
What do you mean by "about to"?

30:15.750 --> 30:16.350
About to.

30:17.590 --> 30:19.390
It hasn't been implemented yet.

30:24.510 --> 30:25.070
Chief Qi.

30:29.790 --> 30:30.680
If you have any thoughts,

30:30.680 --> 30:31.480
speak up.

30:33.550 --> 30:35.000
Why can't we

30:35.030 --> 30:36.230
take the initiative?

30:37.350 --> 30:39.660
How do we take the initiative?

30:40.790 --> 30:42.510
Find a chance to get close to them.

30:42.510 --> 30:45.110
That's how we can
get evidence of their crimes.

30:46.160 --> 30:46.690
Chief Qi,

30:47.200 --> 30:47.930
Chief Zhang,

30:48.200 --> 30:49.000
Captain Wang.

30:49.350 --> 30:50.880
Have you ever thought about

30:50.960 --> 30:52.550
sending an undercover agent

30:52.550 --> 30:54.350
to infiltrate Zhou Rong's team?

30:54.590 --> 30:56.250
-I think...
-I don't think so.

30:57.510 --> 30:58.000
No way.

30:59.480 --> 31:01.540
Handling cases isn't making movies.

31:01.760 --> 31:03.280
Even based on movie plots,

31:03.310 --> 31:04.960
for someone as cautious as Zhou Rong,

31:04.960 --> 31:06.890
it'll be impossible for the mole

31:07.030 --> 31:08.500
to gain his trust

31:08.590 --> 31:10.050
without a few years' time.

31:11.270 --> 31:12.930
Going undercover won't work.

31:13.880 --> 31:14.640
I interrupted you just now.

31:14.640 --> 31:15.570
What did you say?

31:15.830 --> 31:16.960
I said you're right.

31:17.240 --> 31:19.100
Going undercover won't work.

31:54.840 --> 31:55.930
It's so big.

31:56.790 --> 31:57.720
Chao, it's heavily guarded.

31:57.720 --> 31:58.550
Can we get in?

31:58.880 --> 32:00.390
When my dad remarried,

32:01.400 --> 32:03.930
I supervised the renovation
of the new house.

32:04.860 --> 32:06.390
It was my own dad's wedding.

32:06.390 --> 32:07.790
How could I not do my best?

32:09.460 --> 32:11.720
But even the best-laid plans have flaws.

32:11.750 --> 32:14.210
I forgot to install curtains
in the bedroom.

32:14.400 --> 32:15.400
It was discovered by the neighbors
across the street

32:15.400 --> 32:17.070
on the wedding night.

32:17.960 --> 32:18.960
What did they see?

32:19.110 --> 32:20.460
That's not the point.

32:20.480 --> 32:21.960
My point is,

32:22.000 --> 32:23.820
with so much to worry about,

32:23.930 --> 32:24.480
there will definitely be

32:24.480 --> 32:25.680
things you overlook.

32:26.500 --> 32:27.850
With such a large area,

32:28.480 --> 32:30.080
there are always loopholes.

32:30.270 --> 32:31.920
There must be a way in.

32:33.030 --> 32:33.960
What do you think?

32:33.960 --> 32:34.400
Chao,

32:35.030 --> 32:36.430
when your dad remarried,

32:36.880 --> 32:38.000
what did the neighbor across the street

32:38.000 --> 32:38.790
see?

32:40.440 --> 32:42.110
You can't explain ice to a summer insect.

32:42.110 --> 32:43.040
What do you mean?

32:44.680 --> 32:45.940
What do you mean, Chao?

32:46.160 --> 32:46.550
Chao?

32:48.240 --> 32:49.200
Are you mad?

32:49.220 --> 32:50.510
I'm sorry, okay?

32:54.920 --> 32:57.120
Let's go around the back and take a look.

33:16.130 --> 33:18.610
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

33:19.640 --> 33:20.900
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

33:22.390 --> 33:24.800
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

33:25.680 --> 33:27.120
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

33:28.270 --> 33:29.100
♪ Oh Gimme ♪

33:30.210 --> 33:32.190
♪ Dance me in the richness ♪

33:33.350 --> 33:34.850
♪ Raining make it rain ♪

33:35.480 --> 33:38.100
♪ Oh cash is my revolution ♪

33:41.130 --> 33:43.640
♪ Get your head in the game,
we're all smart people here ♪

33:44.250 --> 33:47.070
♪ Don't drag your feet,
even gold slips through slow hands ♪

33:47.740 --> 33:49.450
♪ I beat it, I beat it ♪

33:47.960 --> 33:48.440
Look.

33:53.590 --> 33:54.440
Help me up!

33:56.000 --> 33:57.430
Pull harder!

33:58.110 --> 33:58.830
Pull me!

34:04.510 --> 34:06.550
Chao, what do we do now?

34:13.550 --> 34:14.290
Everyone,

34:14.320 --> 34:15.920
let's groove!

34:21.670 --> 34:22.480
Mr. Rong!

34:23.590 --> 34:25.719
Zhu Yifei has arrived at Sanjiangkou.

34:25.800 --> 34:26.840
But he wants to

34:26.920 --> 34:27.980
hold off on the deal

34:28.030 --> 34:29.440
for a couple of days.

34:29.670 --> 34:30.730
Hold off?

34:30.800 --> 34:31.590
Very good.

34:31.630 --> 34:33.520
Let's speed up the tempo!

34:34.880 --> 34:35.620
Wait.

34:35.880 --> 34:37.380
Who does he think he is?

34:37.800 --> 34:39.000
I paid the money.

34:39.030 --> 34:40.489
Why does he get to hold off?

34:40.550 --> 34:41.400
Tell him to go ask

34:41.400 --> 34:42.730
who owns Sanjiangkou.

34:43.760 --> 34:44.550
[Restricted Number]

34:45.590 --> 34:46.440
Give it to me.

34:48.400 --> 34:49.030
Hello.

34:49.590 --> 34:50.340
Mr. Zhu,

34:50.480 --> 34:51.360
this is Zhou Rong.

34:51.360 --> 34:52.280
Keep up with the music.

34:52.280 --> 34:53.870
Let's groove!

34:53.920 --> 34:54.620
Come on.

34:54.710 --> 34:55.480
Hello,

34:56.110 --> 34:57.100
can you hear me?

34:57.150 --> 34:58.230
It's Zhou Rong!

34:58.320 --> 34:59.870
Speed up.

35:00.070 --> 35:01.000
Faster.

35:01.110 --> 35:01.800
Hello?

35:01.880 --> 35:03.280
Speed up.

35:03.400 --> 35:04.730
Speed up.

35:04.800 --> 35:05.510
Stop.

35:05.880 --> 35:06.550
Stop.

35:07.480 --> 35:08.190
Stop.

35:09.070 --> 35:10.030
Stop!

35:11.710 --> 35:13.920
No, I said stop the music.

35:13.940 --> 35:14.510
Music.

35:18.980 --> 35:20.040
Hello.

35:21.920 --> 35:22.920
Hold off, my ass!

35:25.550 --> 35:27.010
Are you alright, Mr. Rong?

35:27.480 --> 35:28.110
I'm fine.

35:28.900 --> 35:30.700
If he needs time, let him have it.

35:31.550 --> 35:32.670
With how smart Zhu Yifei is,

35:32.670 --> 35:35.070
he won't do anything
to get himself killed.

35:35.110 --> 35:35.910
Pass the word.

35:36.510 --> 35:38.230
Don't do anything for the next two days.

35:38.230 --> 35:39.550
Don't cause any trouble.

35:39.550 --> 35:40.350
Reassure him.

35:40.710 --> 35:41.150
Yes.

35:42.670 --> 35:43.150
And

35:44.360 --> 35:46.220
Mei Dong was caught by the police.

35:46.400 --> 35:46.760
I don't know

35:46.760 --> 35:48.220
what he told Zhang Yi'ang.

35:48.550 --> 35:49.750
Right now, the police

35:50.400 --> 35:51.800
might already be onto us.

35:52.000 --> 35:52.640
So...

35:53.590 --> 35:54.190
watch out.

35:55.400 --> 35:56.670
I will definitely be careful

35:56.670 --> 35:57.930
and keep a low profile.

35:58.320 --> 35:59.060
No,

35:59.150 --> 36:00.190
just act as usual,

36:00.230 --> 36:00.960
understand?

36:05.920 --> 36:06.480
Jianren,

36:07.710 --> 36:09.040
I'll be honest with you.

36:09.920 --> 36:10.610
If East New Town's loan

36:10.610 --> 36:11.810
doesn't come through

36:12.440 --> 36:14.040
and the police target us too,

36:15.190 --> 36:16.250
I plan to

36:17.440 --> 36:18.630
leave Sanjiangkou.

36:21.320 --> 36:22.250
But don't worry.

36:23.400 --> 36:24.660
I will take you with me.

36:26.480 --> 36:27.310
Where

36:27.840 --> 36:28.510
would we go?

36:30.550 --> 36:32.550
A small island in the South Pacific,

36:32.800 --> 36:33.710
my utopia,

36:34.230 --> 36:34.840
Gondwana.

36:36.030 --> 36:36.800
Gondwana?

36:39.550 --> 36:40.480
Let's eat first.

36:41.670 --> 36:42.800
We have to investigate,

36:42.800 --> 36:44.060
but we also have to eat.

36:44.760 --> 36:46.820
Your brain works faster after a meal.

36:47.230 --> 36:47.690
Yi'ang,

36:48.480 --> 36:49.280
take the lead.

36:51.590 --> 36:52.190
Let's eat.

37:08.030 --> 37:09.890
Do you have any staple food there?

37:10.400 --> 37:11.000
I was only thinking about

37:11.000 --> 37:12.630
the dishes Chief Qi asked me to order,

37:12.630 --> 37:13.940
and forgot the staple food.

37:13.940 --> 37:15.740
Go get some staple food quickly.

37:19.590 --> 37:21.190
Forgot to order staple food.

37:22.670 --> 37:24.350
Young people are careless.

37:24.800 --> 37:26.150
Forgetting to order staple food

37:26.150 --> 37:27.150
is not a big deal.

37:27.670 --> 37:28.730
It's not a big deal,

37:30.400 --> 37:32.860
but it's the small things
that give you away.

37:35.360 --> 37:36.170
Zhou Rong

37:36.590 --> 37:38.070
is very careful.

37:38.400 --> 37:39.230
But that doesn't mean

37:39.230 --> 37:40.280
everyone around him

37:40.280 --> 37:41.210
will be careful.

37:42.110 --> 37:43.290
You mean

37:43.440 --> 37:45.070
to expand the surveillance range?

37:45.070 --> 37:45.480
Right.

37:46.880 --> 37:47.770
You're right.

37:48.920 --> 37:51.180
We need to find a chance to approach them.

37:51.880 --> 37:52.700
Hu Jianren is

37:52.760 --> 37:54.030
Zhou Rong's trusted aide.

37:54.030 --> 37:54.560
Li Qian,

37:55.190 --> 37:56.310
starting tomorrow,

37:56.310 --> 37:57.910
you keep an eye on Hu Jianren.

37:58.320 --> 37:59.670
I'll keep an eye on Li Penggai.

37:59.670 --> 38:00.320
What did you say?

38:00.320 --> 38:02.580
He said he'll go keep an eye
on Li Penggai.

38:03.800 --> 38:05.550
Okay, you keep an eye on Li Penggai.

38:05.550 --> 38:06.320
Chief Qi, I suggest

38:06.320 --> 38:07.670
we split into more groups.

38:07.670 --> 38:09.330
Keep a close eye on all the key people

38:09.330 --> 38:10.330
around Zhou Rong.

38:10.400 --> 38:11.600
If we can catch just one,

38:11.600 --> 38:13.000
we can track down the rest

38:13.320 --> 38:14.480
and make a breakthrough.

38:14.480 --> 38:14.960
Okay.

38:16.110 --> 38:17.040
Let's eat first.

38:21.550 --> 38:23.040
I'm finally back.

38:23.630 --> 38:24.190
Stop.

38:31.800 --> 38:32.860
Goodbye, brother.

38:33.260 --> 38:34.060
Driver, go on!

38:43.230 --> 38:43.760
Gai.

38:48.670 --> 38:50.280
You were supposed to hand in your computer

38:50.280 --> 38:52.000
when you left.

38:51.450 --> 38:53.650
[Du Cong, staff of Zhou Rong's company]

38:52.360 --> 38:53.510
I didn't let them.

38:53.710 --> 38:54.760
I told them not to touch it,

38:54.760 --> 38:56.150
or else Gai would make life hard
for all of them

38:56.150 --> 38:57.150
when he came back.

38:57.630 --> 38:58.560
You're the best.

38:59.630 --> 39:00.360
The best bro.

39:04.190 --> 39:05.190
Is your promotion

39:05.880 --> 39:06.540
confirmed?

39:07.110 --> 39:08.110
Confirmed or not,

39:10.510 --> 39:12.710
I won't be staying here for long anyway.

39:13.230 --> 39:14.060
Gai,

39:14.440 --> 39:16.590
is the company's S600

39:17.190 --> 39:18.590
being used these days?

39:18.960 --> 39:21.020
We have so many cars. Why use that one?

39:26.070 --> 39:27.800
Did Li ask to borrow a car again?

39:30.510 --> 39:31.320
Not again.

39:32.230 --> 39:33.490
This is the first time.

39:34.280 --> 39:35.320
I know, Gai.

39:35.360 --> 39:36.360
It's not the right time yet.

39:36.360 --> 39:37.020
Say no more.

39:37.630 --> 39:38.690
It's not easy for Li

39:38.920 --> 39:40.320
to run a wedding company.

39:41.230 --> 39:42.510
You two finally started dating.

39:42.510 --> 39:43.110
How can you not lend her a car

39:43.110 --> 39:43.760
when she asks?

39:43.760 --> 39:44.230
Lend it.

39:45.400 --> 39:46.800
Mr. Rong has so many cars.

39:46.800 --> 39:48.530
He won't mind one less. Lend it.

39:50.840 --> 39:51.400
Gai.

39:51.480 --> 39:51.920
Hey, hey,

39:51.920 --> 39:52.510
what are you doing?

39:52.510 --> 39:53.570
What are you doing?

39:54.230 --> 39:54.760
Stand up.

39:55.760 --> 39:56.920
Look at you.

40:00.480 --> 40:00.940
Take it.

40:03.710 --> 40:04.740
Drive safely.

40:05.400 --> 40:06.380
Thanks, Gai.

40:12.660 --> 40:14.860
Give me two servings of meat dumplings.

40:15.000 --> 40:15.830
And then?

40:16.150 --> 40:16.840
Eggs...

40:17.440 --> 40:18.630
Give me three eggs.

40:18.710 --> 40:19.840
Here, three for you.

40:20.550 --> 40:21.510
Need anything else?

40:21.510 --> 40:22.440
Get me some milk.

40:22.990 --> 40:24.030
I paid you.

40:30.000 --> 40:30.510
Thanks.

40:30.630 --> 40:31.280
A milk too.

40:31.360 --> 40:32.070
I don't drink that.

40:32.070 --> 40:33.000
Not that one. This one.

40:33.000 --> 40:33.660
Sure thing.

40:34.000 --> 40:34.600
Take care.

40:36.800 --> 40:37.960
What are you honking for?

40:37.960 --> 40:38.800
No manners.

40:50.880 --> 40:52.360
Shy.

40:52.360 --> 40:53.360
S-H-Y.

40:57.670 --> 40:58.840
Hu Jianren didn't go to the company.

40:58.840 --> 40:59.440
I repeat,

40:59.510 --> 41:01.510
Hu Jianren didn't go to the company.

41:01.540 --> 41:12.020
[Sanjiangkou Children's Training Center]

41:32.150 --> 41:34.560
This is a little girl.

41:34.920 --> 41:38.090
-This is a little girl.
-This is a little girl.

41:38.230 --> 41:40.320
And she has a little curl.

41:40.670 --> 41:44.310
-And she has a little curl.
-And she has a little curl.

41:50.410 --> 41:53.240
-And when she is bad...
-And when she is bad...

41:53.320 --> 41:55.920
She is very, very bad.

41:56.000 --> 41:59.320
-She is...
-She is very, very bad.

41:59.410 --> 42:00.210
What's wrong?

42:00.880 --> 42:03.440
I want to go to WC.

42:03.510 --> 42:04.920
No, no, no, listen to me.

42:05.070 --> 42:07.070
I want to go to toilet.

42:08.060 --> 42:10.480
I want go to toilet.

42:10.670 --> 42:11.440
Toilet.

42:11.880 --> 42:12.280
Toi...

42:12.480 --> 42:14.090
Teacher, it's urgent.

42:14.210 --> 42:15.060
Go ahead.

42:15.440 --> 42:16.040
Thank you.

42:36.700 --> 42:38.270
This is the children's center.

42:38.270 --> 42:40.360
There are only kids taking classes inside.

42:40.360 --> 42:41.890
Who is he going to meet here?

42:43.510 --> 42:44.370
Keep watching.

42:44.880 --> 42:46.610
There must be something wrong.

42:48.760 --> 42:51.080
He is a bit shy.

42:51.320 --> 42:54.360
-He is a bit shy.
-He is a bit shy.

42:54.360 --> 42:54.880
Bit.

42:55.400 --> 42:56.280
Bit.

42:56.510 --> 42:57.030
Bit.

42:57.510 --> 42:58.320
Bit.

43:05.150 --> 43:05.630
Halt.
